            'liq.ui.target_thrust_level_for_the_liquid': 'Engine thrust at the sea-level design point, in N: ambient pressure 1.01325 bar (ISA sea level). For an open cycle (gas generator, tap-off) it is the ENGINE thrust = main chamber + turbine exhaust; the propellant flow, the throat and the tanks are sized from it. A vacuum thrust cannot be entered as the target: the vacuum thrust is computed from this design point and published separately. Accepted range: 100 N - 10 MN. This field is a required design point: left blank, the request is refused by name.',
